@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam lineThickness 1
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 160
hide empty members
title ScamQuest - Submit Decision Sequence Diagram
actor Student
boundary "React Interface" as UI
control "Express API" as API
database "SQLite Database" as DB
Student -> UI : Select choice
UI -> API : POST decision(attemptId, choiceId, requestId)
activate API
API -> API : Validate session and request fields
API -> DB : Load attempt, scene and selected choice
DB --> API : Current data
API -> API : Check ownership, state and choice membership
alt Invalid request or unauthorized access
  API --> UI : Error; no progress update
  UI --> Student : Display understandable error
else Valid request
  API -> DB : Begin transaction; check requestId
  alt Decision already recorded
    DB --> API : Previously recorded result
    API -> DB : End transaction without changes
    API --> UI : Return saved result; no duplicate points
  else New decision
    API -> API : Determine next scene and scoring update
    API -> DB : Save decision and update progress
    opt Final decision completes attempt
      API -> API : Normalize score and prepare feedback
      API -> DB : Save score and Completed state
    end
    API -> DB : Commit transaction
    DB --> API : Commit confirmed
    API --> UI : Next scene or completed feedback
  end
  UI --> Student : Display saved result
end
deactivate API
note over API, DB
Commit failures roll back the transaction.
The client cannot supply the official score.
end note
@enduml
